WEBVTT

00:16:56.725 --> 00:17:01.325
India will make a big difference
for technology at a global scale.

00:17:01.325 --> 00:17:03.685
So I'm really inspired.


00:17:03.685 --> 00:17:06.465
(Applause)

00:17:09.315 --> 00:17:13.390
We asked him, does he have 
an idea worth sharing?

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:16.630
I think, he told us something important,

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:19.920
that the young generation
is in a rat-race.

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:21.694
Let's do this, let's do that.

00:17:21.694 --> 00:17:26.504
So take a step back 
and think what is your passion.

00:17:26.514 --> 00:17:32.825
Where does your passion lie?
And choose that field.